{"id":"n60877-1-8","stage":1,"title":"불쌍하다 · 可怜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60877-1-8-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 울고 있어?","zh":"怎么哭得这么伤心？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"울고","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c74ed7c613070dfbf2b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60877-1-8-2","ko":"내가 떠나면 홀로 남을 애들이 불쌍해서요.","zh":"我走后孩子们会孤零零留下，想到他们就觉得可怜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠나면","meaning":"离开，离去","explanation":"떠나다：离开，离去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"홀로","meaning":"独自","explanation":"홀로：独自","readings":[{"term":"홀로","audio":"/audio/c518e6332568aa3da099.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87293","senseId":"1","lemma":"홀로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남을","meaning":"留下","explanation":"남다：留下；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"7","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애들이","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불쌍해서요.","meaning":"可怜","explanation":"불쌍하다：可怜；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"불쌍하다","audio":"/audio/8856f8ba4d4c0ed8bc3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60877","senseId":"1","lemma":"불쌍하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"离开，离去","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3","entryId":"53746","definition":"为了到别的地方，脱离所在地。","pronunciation":["떠나다"]},{"id":"c518e6332568aa3d","term":"홀로","zh":"独自","audio":"/audio/c518e6332568aa3da099.mp3","entryId":"87293","definition":"自己一个人。","pronunciation":["홀로"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"留下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"作为某种状况的结果而出现某种状态。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"8856f8ba4d4c0ed8","term":"불쌍하다","zh":"可怜","audio":"/audio/8856f8ba4d4c0ed8bc3d.mp3","entryId":"60877","definition":"境遇或情况不好，让人哀怜和伤心。","pronunciation":["불쌍하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/067d1cb5daff982a55e2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.8,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60877","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.6267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么哭得这么伤心？","我走后孩子们会孤零零留下，想到他们就觉得可怜。","收到伯父七十大寿的邀请了，听说在酒店自助餐厅办。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么哭得这么伤心？","我走后孩子们会孤零零留下，想到他们就觉得可怜。","收到伯父七十大寿的邀请了，听说在酒店自助餐厅办。"],"answer":1}]}
